# Echo Process

The echo process is a simple system utility that repeats the provided input back to the user. It demonstrates basic process handling in 00OS.

## Usage

```
> echo [text to echo]
```

## Parameters

- `text`: The text content to echo back to the user

## Examples

```
> echo Hello, 00OS!
Hello, 00OS!
``` 